reasing, Rally Masters more often come under the authority of the golden-armored warriors. Many Rally Masters complain of the presence of too many generals, but others find ways to continue to function independently on the battlefield.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In the early years, a basic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mandalorian Neo-Crusader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mandalorian_Neo-Crusader","referenceId":"reference:c9f8f945775feb2d"}," achieves promotion to Rally Master after commendation by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Neo-Crusader Marshal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Neo-Crusader_Marshal","referenceId":"reference:0cf9f8707b1d40b8"}," for battlefield heroics. In the later stages of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Wars"},", standards decline so that simply serving with the clans long enough to learn Mando'a and some of their ways is enough to earn promotion.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Neo-Crusader Rally Master Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +5; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"